{"version":1,"content":"<p>聯合國環境規劃署日前發佈《2026年排放差距報告：不可逆轉的臨界點》，警告全球平均氣温升幅預計將超過工業化前水平1.5攝氏度。然而，報告同時指出，只要各國立即採取更加深入且迅速的減排行動，仍有機會將升温超標幅度控制在最低水平，並在本世紀末重新回到1.5攝氏度以內。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583228.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:46.021136+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:20:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:57:59.265133+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"312aa6aaaba4018549dfd96c126ca2a28098b503fc06f0553f3775fc110c14e3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}